'use strict';(function(root){const esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c])),fmt=n=>Math.ceil(n).toLocaleString('ko-KR'),fixed=new Set(['smoke','coat','stealth','pursuit','efficiency']);const damageKinds=new Set('ambush shadow-stab shadow-rush weak-stab knife assassinate trick-card card-trap surprise shadow-finale venom-knife venom-burst venom-finale phantom-card double exchange phantom-finale sensor sticky remote chain-bombs convergence four-call overdrive'.split(' '));
function icon(d){const a=d.actions[0]||{},k=a.kind||a.op,shape=d.slot===3?'m18 3 4 9 10-4-4 20H8L4 8l10 4Zm-9 29h18':/summon|pet|four-call|double|echoes|turret/.test(k+' '+a.op)?'m18 3 13 15-13 15L5 18Zm0 8v14m-7-7h14':fixed.has(k)||/guard|ward|shield|buff|heal|resonance/.test(k+' '+a.op)?'M18 3 31 9v10c0 8-13 14-13 14S5 27 5 19V9Zm0 8v14m-7-7h14':'m8 26 18-18 7-5-5 9-17 17M6 21l9 9M8 26l-5 7 8-4';return `<svg viewBox="0 0 36 36" aria-hidden="true"><path d="${shape}"/></svg>`;}
function status(g,d){if(!d.unlocked)return{key:'locked',title:'아직 배우지 않은 기술',reason:`캐릭터 Lv.${d.unlock}에 사용할 수 있어요.`,button:'미습득'};if(d.rank>=d.maxRank)return{key:'max',title:'최대 강화 완료',reason:'이 기술의 강화를 모두 마쳤어요.',button:'최대 강화'};if(d.nextLevel>99)return{key:'capped',title:'현재 성장 한도',reason:'현재 최고 캐릭터 레벨에서는 다음 강화 조건에 도달할 수 없어요.',button:'성장 조건 미충족'};if(g.h.level<d.nextLevel)return{key:'level',title:`캐릭터 Lv.${d.nextLevel} 필요`,reason:`현재 Lv.${g.h.level} · ${d.nextLevel-g.h.level}레벨 더 성장하면 강화할 수 있어요.`,button:'레벨 조건 미충족'};if(g.h.gold<d.upgradeCost)return{key:'gold',title:'골드가 부족해요',reason:`${fmt(d.upgradeCost-g.h.gold)} G를 더 모으면 강화할 수 있어요.`,button:'골드 부족'};return{key:'ready',title:'강화할 수 있어요',reason:'강화 단계는 전직 후에도 유지돼요.',button:'강화하기'};}
function comparison(d){const a=d.actions[0]||{},k=a.kind||a.op,knownFixed=a.op==='rogue-kit'&&fixed.has(k)||a.op==='mage-kit'&&k==='efficiency',damage=damageKinds.has(k)||d.actions.some(a=>['hit','area','chain','beam','whirl','barrage','ammo-shot','execute'].includes(a.op));if(knownFixed)return{label:'보조 효과',current:'현재 효과',next:'동일',note:'이 기술은 현재 강화해도 주요 보조 효과가 바뀌지 않아요.',fixed:true};if(damage)return{label:'기본 위력 대비',current:Math.ceil((1+(d.rank-1)*.14)*100-1e-8)+'%',next:Math.ceil((1+d.rank*.14)*100-1e-8)+'%',note:'공격 위력 보정 기준이에요. 지속시간·속박 시간 등 보조 효과의 증가를 뜻하지 않아요.'};return{label:'강화 단계',current:d.rank+'강',next:Math.min(d.maxRank,d.rank+1)+'강',note:'보조 효과는 기술마다 강화 적용 방식이 달라요. 위 설명은 기본 효과예요.'};}
function markup(g,slot=0,result=null,preview=false){if(!Number.isInteger(slot)||slot<0||slot>3)slot=0;const h=g.h,d=g.skillSpec(slot),st=status(g,d),c=comparison(d),max=d.rank>=d.maxRank,canNext=d.unlocked&&!max&&d.nextLevel<=99,specs=[0,1,2,3].map(i=>g.skillSpec(i)),resource=g.resourceSpec(),job=g.p.classes[h.cell];return `<section class="skill-studio"><div class="ss-profile"><div class="ss-character"><canvas width="66" height="66" data-sheet="${esc(g.p.sheet)}" data-cell="${h.cell}" data-height="58" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><div><small>${esc(g.p.name)} · Lv.${h.level}</small><strong>${esc(job.name)}</strong></div></div><div class="ss-wallet"><small>보유 골드</small><b>${fmt(h.gold)}<span> G</span></b></div></div><div class="ss-layout"><nav class="ss-list" aria-label="강화할 스킬 선택">${specs.map((s,i)=>{const t=status(g,s);return `<button class="ss-pick ${i===slot?'selected':''} ${i===3?'is-ultimate':''}" data-skill-panel-slot="${i}" aria-pressed="${i===slot}" aria-controls="ss-detail" aria-label="${esc(s.name)} · ${s.unlocked?s.rank+'강':'미습득'} · ${t.title}"><span class="ss-icon">${icon(s)}<i>${i===3?'ULT':'0'+(i+1)}</i></span><span class="ss-pick-copy"><strong>${esc(s.name)}</strong><small>${s.unlocked?s.rank+' / '+s.maxRank+'강':'Lv.'+s.unlock+' 습득'}</small></span><span class="ss-status-dot ${t.key}" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>`;}).join('')}<p class="ss-list-help">전직 시 네 기술이 함께 열려요.<br>시작 직업은 기술마다 습득 레벨이 달라요.</p></nav><article class="ss-detail ${slot===3?'is-ultimate':''}" id="ss-detail" aria-label="선택한 스킬 상세"><header class="ss-detail-title"><div><small>${slot===3?'ULTIMATE':'SKILL 0'+(slot+1)}</small><h3>${esc(d.name)}</h3></div><span>${d.unlocked?d.rank+'강':'미습득'}</span></header><div class="ss-ranks" aria-label="${d.unlocked?d.rank:0} / ${d.maxRank}강">${Array.from({length:d.maxRank},(_,i)=>`<i class="${d.unlocked&&i<d.rank?'filled':''} ${result&&i===d.rank-1?'just-filled':''}"></i>`).join('')}</div><div class="ss-result ${result?'show':''}" role="status" aria-live="polite">${result?`<b>강화 완료</b><span>${esc(result.name)} · ${result.from}강 → ${result.to}강</span>`:''}</div><div class="ss-chips"><span>${esc(resource.name)} <b>${d.cost}</b></span><span>재사용 <b>${d.cd?d.cd+'초':'자원 충전'}</b></span><span>습득 <b>Lv.${d.unlock}</b></span></div><div class="ss-effect"><div class="ss-section-heading"><h4>기술 효과</h4><span>기본 효과</span></div><p>${esc(d.description)}</p>${d.inherited?`<p class="ss-inherited">이전 궁극기 유지 · Lv.${d.replacementUnlock}에 ${esc(d.replacementName)} 습득</p>`:''}</div><button class="ss-preview-toggle" data-skill-panel-preview="1" aria-expanded="${preview}">${preview?'연출 접기':'기본 연출 미리보기'}<span>${preview?'−':'▶'}</span></button>${preview?`<div class="ss-preview"><canvas id="preview-field" width="600" height="320" role="img" aria-label="${esc(d.name)} 기본 연출 미리보기"></canvas><button data-skill-panel-replay="1" aria-label="선택한 스킬 연출 다시 재생">↻ 다시 재생</button></div>`:''}<section class="ss-growth"><div class="ss-section-heading"><h4>${max?'완성한 기술':'다음 강화'}</h4><span>${max?'MAX':d.rank+'강 → '+(d.rank+1)+'강'}</span></div><div class="ss-comparison ${c.fixed?'unchanged':''}"><span>${c.label}</span><div><b>${esc(c.current)}</b>${!max?`<i>→</i><strong>${canNext?esc(c.next):'—'}</strong>`:'<strong>MAX</strong>'}</div></div><p class="ss-growth-note">${esc(c.note)}</p>${st.key!=='ready'&&st.key!=='max'?`<p class="ss-condition">${esc(st.reason)}</p>`:''}</section></article></div><footer class="ss-footer"><div class="ss-payment"><span>${max?'강화 완료':'필요 골드'}</span><strong>${max?'MAX':fmt(d.upgradeCost)+' G'}</strong>${!max?`<small>${st.key==='ready'?'강화 후 '+fmt(h.gold-d.upgradeCost)+' G':st.key==='gold'?fmt(d.upgradeCost-h.gold)+' G 부족':'보유 '+fmt(h.gold)+' G'}</small>`:''}</div><div class="ss-action"><div><b>${st.title}</b><span>${esc(st.reason)}</span></div><button class="ss-upgrade" data-skill-upgrade="${slot+1}" ${st.key==='ready'?'':'disabled'}>${st.button}${st.key==='ready'?'<span>＋</span>':''}</button></div></footer></section>`;}
const API={markup,status,comparison,icon};if(typeof module!=='undefined')module.exports=API;root.RPG_SKILL_PANEL=API;})(typeof window!=='undefined'?window:globalThis);
